SAMPLE — not a live changelog.

This is a template for the eventual 1.0.0 release note. Before shipping,
copy it to a file named after that build's versionCode (e.g. "40.txt" —
fastlane and F-Droid key changelogs by versionCode, NOT versionName) and
delete this .example file. Keep each changelog under ~500 characters for
Google Play.

---

Marmalade TTS 1.0.0 — the first stable release.

- System-wide on-device text-to-speech: use Marmalade as your Android TTS engine across every app.
- Multiple neural engines and voices, installed on demand. Nothing ships in the APK until you choose it.
- Emoji-driven emotional prosody, audio-effect presets, and saved voice personas.
- Long-form reading with lock-screen controls; share-sheet, read-selection, and Quick Settings shortcuts.

Private by design: no analytics, no ads, no accounts, no cloud.
